==== PlaceOneSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the sound that will play when an item is placed on the ground.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
PlaceOneSound = BoxOfRoundsPlaceOne,
</syntaxhighlight>
